WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.491
Skill development requires practice, feedback, correction, and repetition.

2
00:00:03.491 --> 00:00:11.783
Whether the skill is technical troubleshooting, writing, communication, analysis, or a physical action, learners need repeated high-quality attempts.

3
00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:18.329
Sleep supports this indirectly by supporting the attention and recovery that make repeated practice useful.

4
00:00:18.329 --> 00:00:22.256
Poor recovery can turn practice into low-quality repetition.

5
00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:30.984
Procedural learning, at a high level, involves getting better at how to do something, not only knowing facts about it.

6
00:00:30.984 --> 00:00:37.094
Automaticity can develop when parts of a skill require less conscious effort over time.

7
00:00:37.094 --> 00:00:40.585
That can free attention for judgment and adaptation.

8
00:00:40.585 --> 00:00:46.695
But automaticity grows from practice with feedback, not from time spent near the skill.

9
00:00:46.695 --> 00:00:55.859
Mental rehearsal can be useful in a general way when it helps someone prepare steps, anticipate decisions, or review a performance.

10
00:00:55.859 --> 00:00:59.351
It should not replace real practice or feedback.

11
00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:08.079
For example, a learner might mentally walk through a troubleshooting sequence, then practice on a scenario and compare the result.

12
00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:12.443
Sleep and recovery help make these cycles sustainable across sessions.

13
00:01:12.443 --> 00:01:16.370
Measure skill by performance, not just time spent practicing.

14
00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:19.425
Did the learner find defects more reliably?

15
00:01:19.425 --> 00:01:20.734
Write more clearly?

16
00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.480
Ask better diagnostic questions?

17
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.225
Communicate uncertainty more effectively?

18
00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:32.517
Practice time matters because it creates opportunity, but sleep, recovery, and feedback influence whether that opportunity becomes real improvement.
